---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Live Cam
permalink: /live/
description: "The order's camera, when it is running: a live feed for members who hold the watchword."
---

<section class="page-head">
  <p class="kicker">The Open Window</p>
  <h1>Live Cam</h1>
  <p class="lede muted">When the order has something worth watching as it happens &mdash; a working, a
  build, a conversation, a sky &mdash; it opens a window here. Members with the watchword for that
  feed can look through it.</p>
</section>

<section class="wrap narrow reveal">
  <div class="frame frame--first illuminated">
    <p><span class="drop">T</span>wo locks, and they are different locks. You need an account on this
    site, because a feed is not for the street; and you need the <strong>watchword</strong> for that
    particular feed, which is set fresh each time and given out by whoever is broadcasting. An account
    is not an invitation, and a shared word is not an identity, so both are asked for.</p>
    <p class="muted small">How it works, since you will notice: there is no media server behind this
    site. The camera records two seconds at a time and your browser plays those segments as they land,
    which puts you a handful of seconds behind the room. It is a real window, just a slightly slow
    one &mdash; and it is honest about that rather than pretending to be a broadcast truck.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="divider">&#10022;</div>

<section class="wrap narrow reveal" id="live-watch">
  <div class="frame">
    <p class="kicker">What is open now</p>
    <ul class="live-list" data-lw="list">
      <li class="muted small">Looking&hellip;</li>
    </ul>

    <div data-lw="gate" hidden>
      <div class="divider">&#10022;</div>
      <p class="kicker">The watchword for <span data-lw="chosen"></span></p>
      <div class="admin-signin">
        <label for="lw-word">Watchword</label>
        <input type="password" id="lw-word" data-lw="word" autocomplete="one-time-code">
        <button type="button" class="btn btn--small" data-lw="enter">Look through</button>
      </div>
      <p class="muted xsmall">You must be signed in as a member. Not one yet? <a href="/join/">Join the order</a>.</p>
    </div>

    <p class="auth-msg" data-lw="msg"></p>

    <div data-lw="stage" hidden>
      <video class="live-video" data-lw="video" controls playsinline
             aria-label="The live feed" role="img"></video>
      <p class="muted xsmall">Running a few seconds behind. If it stalls, the broadcaster's
      connection hiccuped; it catches itself up.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="wrap narrow reveal" id="live-room" hidden>
  <div class="frame">
    <p class="kicker">The Room</p>
    <div class="cam-wall" data-lr="wall"></div>

    <div class="room-grid">
      <div class="room-chat">
        <div class="chat-log" data-lr="log">
          <ul class="chat-lines" data-lr="lines"></ul>
        </div>
        <form class="chat-say">
          <label for="lr-say" class="sr-only">Say something to the room</label>
          <input type="text" id="lr-say" data-lr="saybox" maxlength="600" autocomplete="off"
                 placeholder="Say something to the room">
          <button type="submit" class="btn btn--small" data-lr="send">Say it</button>
        </form>
        <p class="muted xsmall">In the room: <span data-lr="people">&mdash;</span></p>
      </div>

      <div class="room-side">
        <button type="button" class="btn btn--small btn--ghost" data-lr="camera">Put my camera up</button>
        <div class="countdown" data-lr="count" hidden></div>
        <video class="live-mirror" data-lr="own" muted playsinline hidden
               aria-label="Your own camera" role="img"></video>
        <p class="muted xsmall">Your camera and microphone only go up if the broadcaster has opened
        the floor to you, and they can lower them again at any moment. Everything here is live and
        nothing is kept.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="divider">&#10022;</div>

<section class="wrap narrow admin-media" id="live-admin">
  <div class="btn-row">
    <button type="button" class="btn btn--ghost" data-lv="open" aria-expanded="false">Admin Only</button>
    <span class="muted xsmall">Open a feed from this machine's camera, with a watchword of your choosing.</span>
  </div>

  <div class="frame admin-panel" data-lv="panel" hidden>
    <p class="kicker">The Order&rsquo;s Passcode</p>
    <div class="admin-signin">
      <label for="lv-pass">Passcode</label>
      <input type="password" id="lv-pass" data-lv="pass" autocomplete="current-password">
      <button type="button" class="btn btn--small" data-lv="signin">Open the door</button>
    </div>
    <p class="auth-msg" data-lv="msg"></p>

    <div data-lv="work" hidden>
      <div class="divider">&#10022;</div>
      <div class="am-fields">
        <div>
          <label for="lv-title">What this feed is</label>
          <input type="text" id="lv-title" data-lv="title" maxlength="160" placeholder="Cutting a rune set, start to finish">
        </div>
        <div>
          <label for="lv-word">Watchword for this feed</label>
          <input type="text" id="lv-word" data-lv="word" maxlength="120" autocomplete="off"
                 placeholder="set it fresh every time">
        </div>
        <div>
          <label for="lv-source">Camera or microphone</label>
          <select id="lv-source" data-lv="source">
            <option value="cam">Camera and microphone</option>
            <option value="mic">Microphone only</option>
          </select>
        </div>
        <div>
          <label for="lv-quality">Quality</label>
          <select id="lv-quality" data-lv="quality">
            <option value="low">Low &mdash; kindest to a weak line</option>
            <option value="mid" selected>Middling</option>
            <option value="high">High &mdash; needs a good line both ends</option>
          </select>
        </div>
      </div>
      <label for="lv-note">A line about it, shown beside the title</label>
      <input type="text" id="lv-note" data-lv="note" maxlength="400">

      <div class="btn-row">
        <button type="button" class="btn" data-lv="start">Start the feed &mdash; ten second countdown</button>
        <button type="button" class="btn btn--ghost" data-lv="stop" disabled>End the feed</button>
      </div>
      <div class="countdown" data-lv="count" hidden></div>

      <video class="live-mirror" data-lv="mirror" muted playsinline
             aria-label="What the camera is seeing" role="img"></video>
      <p class="muted xsmall">Ending a feed deletes its segments. Nothing of a live feed is kept
      &mdash; if you want the recording, record it on the Videos page instead.</p>

      <div class="divider">&#10022;</div>
      <p class="kicker">The Director&rsquo;s Desk</p>
      <p class="muted xsmall">What the watchers receive is the <em>programme</em> below, not the raw
      camera &mdash; so a plate you draw here, or a video off your disk, goes out on the same feed with
      no second connection and nothing uploaded. Cut with the buttons; the fade is 260 milliseconds
      each way.</p>

      <div class="programme" data-lv="programme">
        <p class="muted small">The gallery is dark. Open the camera to light it.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="btn-row air-row" role="group" aria-label="What goes out on the feed">
        <button type="button" class="btn btn--small" data-air="camera">Camera</button>
        <button type="button" class="btn btn--small" data-air="plate">Plate</button>
        <button type="button" class="btn btn--small" data-air="tape">Tape</button>
        <button type="button" class="btn btn--small" data-air="split">Split</button>
        <button type="button" class="btn btn--small" data-air="inset">Plate + inset</button>
        <span class="muted xsmall">On air: <strong data-lv="on-air">camera</strong></span>
      </div>
      <div class="switch-row">
        <label class="switch"><input type="checkbox" data-lv="fade" checked> Fade between cuts</label>
        <label class="switch"><input type="checkbox" data-lv="cap-on"> Show the lower third</label>
        <label class="switch"><input type="checkbox" data-lv="tape-back" checked> Back to camera when the tape ends</label>
      </div>

      <div class="am-fields">
        <div>
          <label for="lv-cap">Lower third &mdash; name | what they are</label>
          <input type="text" id="lv-cap" data-lv="cap-text" maxlength="140"
                 placeholder="Edward Gregory | co-founder, EGregoRA">
        </div>
        <div>
          <label for="lv-badge">Corner badge</label>
          <select id="lv-badge" data-lv="badge">
            <option value="">None</option>
            <option value="LIVE">LIVE</option>
            <option value="RECORDED EARLIER">RECORDED EARLIER</option>
            <option value="THE ORDER">THE ORDER</option>
          </select>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="divider">&#10022;</div>
      <p class="kicker">Plates &mdash; the infographic composer</p>
      <p class="muted xsmall">Every plate is drawn here, in the browser, as vector shapes on a canvas:
      no image generator, no waiting, no network. Type and it redraws. Keep the ones that work and
      they stay in this machine&rsquo;s deck for the next broadcast.</p>

      <div class="am-fields">
        <div>
          <label for="lv-pk">Kind of plate</label>
          <select id="lv-pk" data-lv="pk"></select>
          <p class="muted xsmall" data-lv="p-hint"></p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <label for="lv-pacc">Accent</label>
          <select id="lv-pacc" data-lv="p-accent">
            <option value="gold">Gold</option>
            <option value="green">Verdant</option>
            <option value="rose">Rose</option>
            <option value="blue">Blue</option>
          </select>
        </div>
        <div>
          <label for="lv-pkick">Kicker</label>
          <input type="text" id="lv-pkick" data-lv="p-kicker" maxlength="40" value="Limb I">
        </div>
        <div>
          <label for="lv-ptitle">Title</label>
          <input type="text" id="lv-ptitle" data-lv="p-title" maxlength="90" value="What the ether is">
        </div>
      </div>
      <label for="lv-psub">Line under the title</label>
      <input type="text" id="lv-psub" data-lv="p-sub" maxlength="160"
             value="One clause was struck out, not the substrate">
      <label for="lv-plines">The lines &mdash; one per row, split with a vertical bar</label>
      <textarea id="lv-plines" data-lv="p-lines" rows="5">Michelson&ndash;Morley, 1887 | no rest frame survives
Dirac, 1951 | the substrate returns as the quantum field
Casimir, 1948 | the vacuum pushes, so it is not nothing</textarea>

      <div class="plate-shop">
        <div class="plate-view" data-lv="p-preview"></div>
        <div class="btn-row">
          <button type="button" class="btn btn--small" data-lv="p-air">Put this on air</button>
          <button type="button" class="btn btn--small btn--ghost" data-lv="p-save">Keep it in the deck</button>
          <button type="button" class="btn btn--small btn--ghost" data-lv="deck-clear">Empty the deck</button>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="deck" data-lv="deck"></div>

      <div class="divider">&#10022;</div>
      <p class="kicker">Tape &mdash; a video played out on the feed</p>
      <p class="muted xsmall">Choose a file from this machine. It is never uploaded: it plays here and
      is re-recorded as part of the programme, which is why a two-hour film costs the feed nothing
      extra. Its sound is mixed with yours on the two faders below.</p>
      <label for="lv-tape-file">The file</label>
      <input type="file" id="lv-tape-file" data-lv="tape-file" accept="video/*">
      <video class="live-mirror tape-deck" data-lv="tape" playsinline
             aria-label="The tape, as it will go out" role="img"></video>
      <div class="tape-bar"><span data-lv="tape-bar"></span></div>
      <div class="btn-row">
        <button type="button" class="btn btn--small" data-lv="tape-air">Play it out</button>
        <button type="button" class="btn btn--small btn--ghost" data-lv="tape-play">Play</button>
        <button type="button" class="btn btn--small btn--ghost" data-lv="tape-pause">Hold</button>
        <button type="button" class="btn btn--small btn--ghost" data-lv="tape-back10">&minus;10s</button>
        <button type="button" class="btn btn--small btn--ghost" data-lv="tape-on10">+10s</button>
        <button type="button" class="btn btn--small btn--ghost" data-lv="tape-restart">Back to the top</button>
        <label class="switch"><input type="checkbox" data-lv="tape-loop"> Loop</label>
        <span class="muted xsmall" data-lv="tape-time"></span>
      </div>
      <div class="am-fields">
        <div>
          <label for="lv-mic-level">Your microphone</label>
          <input type="range" id="lv-mic-level" data-lv="mic-level" min="0" max="140" value="100">
        </div>
        <div>
          <label for="lv-tape-level">The tape&rsquo;s sound</label>
          <input type="range" id="lv-tape-level" data-lv="tape-level" min="0" max="140" value="100">
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="divider">&#10022;</div>
      <p class="kicker">Who is in the room</p>
      <p class="muted xsmall">Tick what each person may do. Blocking takes the chat, the camera and
      the room away at once, so a nuisance is one click rather than three.</p>
      <div data-lv="people"></div>

      <label for="lv-order-line">A line from The Order</label>
      <div class="admin-signin">
        <input type="text" id="lv-order-line" data-lv="order-line" maxlength="600"
               placeholder="spoken into the chat as The Order">
        <button type="button" class="btn btn--small" data-lv="order-say">Say it</button>
      </div>

      <div class="divider">&#10022;</div>
      <p class="kicker">Feeds</p>
      <div data-lv="mine"></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<script type="module" src="/assets/js/live.js?v={{ build.id }}"></script>
